Package: helvetia
Type: Package
Title: Consistent Access to Swiss Public Statistics, Regional
        Classifications and Spatial Data
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andri", "Signorell", email = "andri@signorell.net",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4311-1969")),
    person("Juerg", "Guggenbuehl", role = "ctb",
           comment = "map union functions, from bfsMaps"))
Description: Standardised access to official Swiss municipality registers
    (historicised municipality list 'AGVCH'), municipality mutations,
    population statistics ('STATPOP' via the 'PXWeb' API of the Swiss Federal
    Statistical Office), municipal boundaries ('swissBOUNDARIES3D') and land
    use statistics ('Arealstatistik', nomenclature 'NOAS04'), together with
    the generalised map geometries of the Swiss Federal Statistical Office
    ('ThemaKart') with tools to draw thematic maps, and the health insurance
    premium regions of the Federal Office of Public Health; supersedes
    'bfsMaps'.
    All sources are mapped to a common, historicisable data model with
    explicit reference dates, validated keys, local caching and source
    metadata.
